      "$kind": "code",
      "Caption": "The first thing we did",
      "Code": "public interface IRepository\u003CT\u003E { ... }\npublic class Repository\u003CT\u003E : IRepository\u003CT\u003E { ... }\npublic interface IUnitOfWork { ... }",
      "Language": "csharp",
