      "IsVisible": true,
      "IsLocked": false
    },
    {
      "$kind": "custombox",
      "Header": "What did that feature take?",
      "Body": "",
      "BulletsText": "A new method on IOrderRepository\nAn implementation with Include \u002B ThenInclude\nIt loaded whole entities (couldn\u0027t Select into a DTO)\nMore methods for paging and the new filter\n8 nearly identical methods in one repository",
