      "$kind": "code",
      "Caption": "What we changed",
      "Code": "await db.Orders\n    .AsNoTracking()\n    .Where(o =\u003E o.Status == q.Status)\n    .OrderByDescending(o =\u003E o.UpdatedAt)\n    .Select(o =\u003E new OrderListItem(\n        o.Id, o.Customer.Name, o.Items.Count))\n    .ToListAsync();",
